{
  "info": {
    "name": "Sanad Auth",
    "description": "Every current Auth request with success and failure examples.\n\nUse the Sanad Local environment.\nDevelopment base URL: https://localhost:7296\n\nPlaceholders only. Do not put real JWT keys, SMTP passwords, SMS Misr secrets, or live OTPs in this file.\n\nSaved examples show the HTTP status, body, and `code` the API actually maps. Framework 401/403 (missing token / restricted token) have no Sanad `code`.",
